<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-CA">Outstanding commitment:</spa=
n></b><span lang=3D"EN-CA">=C2=A0an outstanding commitment (unpaid invoice)=
 occurs when the grant recipient, or administering institution,
 has received a good or service before the end date of the grant or, if app=
licable, within the ATUF period of the grant and the invoice for the good o=
r service was not paid within that timeline.</span><u></u><u></u></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-CA">=C2=A0</span><u></u><u></u></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b><span lang=3D"EN-CA">Pre-payment for the cost of =
